glthread support for devkitPro switch-mesa 20.1.0 (applies on top of switch-mesa-20.1.0-5.patch)

- egl_switch: provide the set_background_context hook glthread's worker thread calls on startup,
  start glthread on the first make_current when MESA_GLTHREAD is set, and wait for the worker
  before switching contexts and before swapping buffers
- u_thread: give Mesa threads a 4 MiB stack; libnx's default of 128 KiB overflows in the shader
  compiler, which runs on the worker thread with glthread

